<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<!--
  Hardened-runtime entitlements of the notarized app: deliberately none.

  The app holds the Accessibility permission (it sends the synthetic Cmd+C),
  and macOS ties that permission to this code signature. Exceptions such as
  com.apple.security.cs.disable-library-validation or
  com.apple.security.cs.allow-unsigned-executable-memory would let foreign
  dylibs or injected code run inside that trusted process; nothing here needs
  them (WKWebView JITs in Apple's own WebContent process, every library is
  Apple's or linked in statically). com.apple.security.network.client only
  matters inside the App Sandbox, which this app does not use.
  src-tauri/tests/security_config.rs keeps this list empty.
-->
<plist version="1.0">
<dict/>
</plist>
